	"title"		"More Vehicles Renew 2 by NgocDuy"
	"description"		"[h1]🚗 MORE VEHICLES RENEW 2 🚗[/h1]
[b]The Definitive 65K/131K Vehicle Limit Breaker & Simulation Turbo Engine for Cities: Skylines[/b]
[i]Completely modernized, independent, and packed with 4 breakthrough technologies by NgocDuy[/i]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]🌟 OVERVIEW: CAPACITY EXPANSION[/h1]
[list]
[*] [b]Active Moving Vehicles:[/b] [b]65,536[/b] (Vanilla: 16,384) — [b]400% Capacity![/b]
[*] [b]Parked Vehicles:[/b] [b]65,536[/b] (Vanilla: 32,768) — [b]200% Capacity![/b]
[*] [b]Total Vehicles Tracked:[/b] [b]131,072[/b]
[*] [b]Real-World Logistics Throughput:[/b] [b]Equivalent to 260,000+ vehicles![/b]
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]⚡ THE 4 CORE BREAKTHROUGHS (BỘ 4 ĐỘT PHÁ CÔNG NGHỆ)[/h1]

[h2]1. 👻 Ghost & Stuck Vehicle Annihilator (Triệt Tiêu Dòng Xe Chết)[/h2]
[list]
[*] [b]The Problem:[/b] Demolishing jammed roads frequently leaves orphaned vehicles floating in the air on deleted segments, permanently taking up thousands of vehicle slots.
[*] [b]The Breakthrough:[/b] Directly hooks [b]NetManager.ReleaseSegmentImplementation[/b] to dissolve any vehicles stranded on demolished segments in real time. Plus an inline simulation frame slice watchdog that safely reclaims deadlocked vehicles.
[/list]

[h2]2. 🚀 Turbo Spawn Dispatcher (Siêu Tốc Độ Phục Hồi Xe)[/h2]
[list]
[*] [b]The Problem:[/b] In vanilla, TransferManager only matches 1 material per frame, meaning it takes 15–20 minutes to respawn vehicles after clearing traffic, starving commercial stores and triggering economic collapse.
[*] [b]The Breakthrough:[/b] Quadruples (4x) transfer matching when active vehicle demand is high. Fully repopulates city logistics across 60,000 vehicles in just [b]30–60 seconds[/b]!
[/list]

[h2]3. 🛡️ Emergency Slot Reclaimer (Bộ Đệm Không Bao Giờ Nghẽn)[/h2]
[list]
[*] [b]The Problem:[/b] When vehicle count hits 65,535, vanilla CreateVehicle returns false, causing factories to abandon with 'Not enough buyers/goods'.
[*] [b]The Breakthrough:[/b] If all 65,535 slots are exhausted, automatically reclaims 1 stagnant ghost vehicle, guaranteeing that essential delivery and emergency vehicles [b]always spawn successfully[/b].
[/list]

[h2]4. 📦 Smart Logistics Multiplier (Sức Tải 260K Phương Tiện)[/h2]
[list]
[*] [b]The Breakthrough:[/b] Doubles the payload capacity of CargoTrucks and GarbageTrucks. Halves the number of freight trucks needed on city streets, granting a 65k vehicle city the logistical throughput of [b]over 260,000 vehicles[/b]!
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]⚠️ COMPATIBILITY & REQUIREMENTS[/h1]
[list]
[*] Requires [b]CitiesHarmony[/b] (standard Harmony 2 dependency).
[*] [b]DO NOT[/b] run concurrently with original More Vehicles or More Vehicles Renewed v1 (disable or unsubscribe from older versions).
[*] 100% compatible with [b]TM:PE[/b], [b]More Network Capacity Renew[/b], [b]Improved Public Transport 2/3[/b], [b]AVO[/b], and [b]Loading Screen Mod[/b].
[*] Full savegame backward and forward compatibility.
[/list]

[hr][/hr]
[i]Developed with care for large city builders by NgocDuy.[/i]"
